Net: model is sound enough to ship the capacity-sensitivity numbers as published; the only finding worth fixing **before** any production routing is the dataset-wide median imputation (P1) and the silent zero-ADV slippage path (P2, but high-impact in tail). Want me to draft a follow-up patch for those two?
